Does it need to stay a Raster? If they are rectangles, I think
vectorization might be quick (fastest way would actually be to convert
the bbox/extent to sp or sf objects). Then either test for intersects
(with a spatial index to skip many), or do an intersection. If you do
the intersection only the rectangle with a single attribute is the one,
also area would have stayed the same.

