> > >> Scott
> > >>
> > >>
> > >> On Wed, Dec 5, 2018 at 3:20 PM Erica Rettig <erica....@gmail.com <mailto:erica....@gmail.com>> wrote:
> > >> I am participating in the Advent of Code (https://adventofcode.com/2018/ <https://adventofcode.com/2018/>), and I am stuck on the following problem:
