> > >> I have a rasterStack of many layers. Each layer represents a rectangle, with all cells that belong to the rectangle marked "1" (everything else is 0, though it could also easily be changed to NA). One of these layers has a rectangle that does not intersect with any other rectangle. Trying to figure out which one.
